    "identity_notes": [
      "Juni, an original confident friendly Korean Arena social stylist. Slightly taller elegant 3-head-tall proportions with readable torso and long articulated trousered legs. Warm medium-brown skin, distinctive softly diamond-shaped face, wide hazel-green almond eyes with clever upper eyelids, thick gently raised expressive eyebrows, rounded nose, one charming cheek dimple and a small asymmetrical closed smile. Jet-black textured hair gathered into two compact high loop buns with loose curly face-framing locks and two cream barrette accents. Ivory cropped bomber jacket with structured oversized sleeves and dusty-rose lining, lilac fitted shirt, high-waisted deep ink-navy wide-leg trousers with a clear stitched waistband, ivory chunky sneakers. Small coral on-ear headphones resting around neck, tiny geometric messenger pouch on a short hip strap; small silver earring. Warm outgoing confident posture, fingers/arms clear of outfit. Distinct vertical fashion silhouette, no shorts, scarf, hiking equipment or hairstyle from concept A. Soft upper-left light and cohesive muted Korean town-compatible colors."
    ]
